status      text not null default 'scheduled',  -- scheduled/sent/failed
retry_count int  not null default 0,
sent_at     timestamptz,
created_at  timestamptz default now(),
unique (user_id, job_id, kind)
)
```

索引清单：applications(user_id, status)、events(application_id, occurred_at)、job_posts(deadline)、favorites(user_id)；reminder_log 的唯一键即主查询路径。埋点表只建 (name, created_at) 一个索引即可。

